{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Opening &amp; Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;Billy the Hero,&quot; a thrilling 2D turn-based RPG set on the Hellish Isle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Second Chance at Life... If You Can Survive It.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with the man deemed the <strong>world's greatest sinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A terrible accident marks the final, horrifying choice of the world\u2019s worst sinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/154e82d307b6de652ee449fe7b75de73.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a world that shouldn't exist. You are <strong>Billy, a powerful, amnesiac 'Muscle Bear' with no memory of your past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the cheerful assistant &quot;<strong>JOJObot</strong>,&quot; you're told this is your second chance: <strong>conquer this hellish island and create your own personal paradise\u2014a harem filled with monstrously charming women.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9a98055f63b1a5feccb49400e01582cf.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=672 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Unholy Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve out your own domain</strong> on the Hellish Isle. <strong>Build facilities, cultivate strange crops,</strong> and transform a desolate wasteland into a thriving (if unconventional) community. <strong>Manage your resources</strong> and create a sanctuary for the <strong>outcasts, demons, and demi-humans</strong> who flock to your banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/1c90a90c0f42b680945ef046d2bfce1b.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for Your Reign and become the King of Sin.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a <strong>deep turn-based combat system.</strong> As Billy, the <strong>'Sinner,' unleash devastating attacks</strong> utilizing every element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your <strong>quirky heroines</strong> to the party, each with <strong>unique classes</strong> like the <strong>Zombie, Jester, Apothecary, Psychopathic Chef, Soul Warden, Vampire, and The Executive.</strong> <strong>Combine their skills</strong> to overcome the island's most terrifying foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/70aa19c39224ae7da0ccef6e2eff8ea8.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Unlikely Bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a cast of <strong>7 unforgettable quirky heroines.</strong> Each has a <strong>deep backstory, personal quests, and a unique perspective</strong> on this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: they have their own wills and often clash with one another. As their leader, you must <strong>mediate their disputes and truly earn their loyalty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the heroine who is right for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Horrifying Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not what it seems. <strong>Vicious manifestations of the Seven Deadly Sins</strong> roam the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to become the <strong>King of Sin</strong>... or are you simply releasing the <strong>painful memories of your own past sins?</strong><br><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>***A Note on AI and Our Art Process (The 'Human Touch' in the Apocalypse)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure your peace of mind that this game is still being crafted by humans (slaving away like the good old days!), we want to clarify our asset creation process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>character design, environment art, and sprites</strong> for <i>Billy the Hero</i> are all derived from <strong>human effort</strong>. Our work begins the old-fashioned way: with advanced tools like a ballpoint pen and paper!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Sprites:</strong> These are <strong>hand-drawn, frame-by-frame</strong>. We personally define all proportions, colors, and poses, including all in-game environmental animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Usage:</strong> We utilize AI solely as a production tool in specific areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailer Animation:</strong> (We create the still images, and the AI assists with motion/animation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Image Upscaling/Quality Improvement.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization/Language Translation.</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This process ensures that the soul and unique style of <i>Billy the Hero</i> remain firmly in the hands of our human artists, while letting technology speed up non-artistic chores.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b251e1c09787e55edb6ffa0a42016ce1.avif?t=1771322398\" width=1470 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594550?t=1771322398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/078407e9b470ca665f2d7d7290d5eedeee1a7027/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771322398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/de1005916847cac441496c83ac738f006840b4de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771322398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/de1005916847cac441496c83ac738f006840b4de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771322398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"\"Billy the Hero features stylized 2D pixel-art violence and blood, primarily during combat and 'Game Over' sequences. The story explores mature psychological themes and Dark Comedy. Players can unlock a Gallery featuring suggestive character illustrations by completing specific objectives. Please note that there is NO explicit nudity (no depiction of genitalia or nipples) and NO graphic sexual violence or sexual intercourse. Additionally, the game contains depictions of tobacco use and references to alcohol.\""},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Opening &amp; Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;Billy the Hero,&quot; a thrilling 2D turn-based RPG set on the Hellish Isle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/bd2a28c6c2a1abc9ea4043dfc1c5b184.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Second Chance at Life... If You Can Survive It.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with the man deemed the <strong>world's greatest sinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9ce2280a095245cd63e00c2e7763f6c6.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A terrible accident marks the final, horrifying choice of the world\u2019s worst sinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/154e82d307b6de652ee449fe7b75de73.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a world that shouldn't exist. You are <strong>Billy, a powerful, amnesiac 'Muscle Bear' with no memory of your past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.poster.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.webm?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b4c44f60cfa45349d7c7d47b04fa3ed3.mp4?t=1771322398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the cheerful assistant &quot;<strong>JOJObot</strong>,&quot; you're told this is your second chance: <strong>conquer this hellish island and create your own personal paradise\u2014a harem filled with monstrously charming women.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/9a98055f63b1a5feccb49400e01582cf.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=672 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Unholy Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve out your own domain</strong> on the Hellish Isle. <strong>Build facilities, cultivate strange crops,</strong> and transform a desolate wasteland into a thriving (if unconventional) community. <strong>Manage your resources</strong> and create a sanctuary for the <strong>outcasts, demons, and demi-humans</strong> who flock to your banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/1c90a90c0f42b680945ef046d2bfce1b.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for Your Reign and become the King of Sin.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a <strong>deep turn-based combat system.</strong> As Billy, the <strong>'Sinner,' unleash devastating attacks</strong> utilizing every element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your <strong>quirky heroines</strong> to the party, each with <strong>unique classes</strong> like the <strong>Zombie, Jester, Apothecary, Psychopathic Chef, Soul Warden, Vampire, and The Executive.</strong> <strong>Combine their skills</strong> to overcome the island's most terrifying foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/70aa19c39224ae7da0ccef6e2eff8ea8.avif?t=1771322398\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Unlikely Bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a cast of <strong>7 unforgettable quirky heroines.</strong> Each has a <strong>deep backstory, personal quests, and a unique perspective</strong> on this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: they have their own wills and often clash with one another. As their leader, you must <strong>mediate their disputes and truly earn their loyalty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the heroine who is right for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Horrifying Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not what it seems. <strong>Vicious manifestations of the Seven Deadly Sins</strong> roam the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to become the <strong>King of Sin</strong>... or are you simply releasing the <strong>painful memories of your own past sins?</strong><br><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>***A Note on AI and Our Art Process (The 'Human Touch' in the Apocalypse)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure your peace of mind that this game is still being crafted by humans (slaving away like the good old days!), we want to clarify our asset creation process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>character design, environment art, and sprites</strong> for <i>Billy the Hero</i> are all derived from <strong>human effort</strong>. Our work begins the old-fashioned way: with advanced tools like a ballpoint pen and paper!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Sprites:</strong> These are <strong>hand-drawn, frame-by-frame</strong>. We personally define all proportions, colors, and poses, including all in-game environmental animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Usage:</strong> We utilize AI solely as a production tool in specific areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailer Animation:</strong> (We create the still images, and the AI assists with motion/animation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Image Upscaling/Quality Improvement.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization/Language Translation.</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This process ensures that the soul and unique style of <i>Billy the Hero</i> remain firmly in the hands of our human artists, while letting technology speed up non-artistic chores.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/extras/b251e1c09787e55edb6ffa0a42016ce1.avif?t=1771322398\" width=1470 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["JOJOJOJOsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594550/0570d233b9c4f9a249c0e1529e9f25cbea4688b2/header.jpg?t=1771322398","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3594550/441965286/8d0e9818373887765bb456aed8ddfb4a2e0e7f59/1767844158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767847606","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3594550/441965286/8d0e9818373887765bb456aed8ddfb4a2e0e7f59/1767844158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767847606","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3594550/441965286/8d0e9818373887765bb456aed8ddfb4a2e0e7f59/1767844158/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=176784